    "Every metric is an unvalidated approximation. Don't use Sfz Health to diagnose, treat, or make any health decision. Always consult a qualified professional." : {

    },
    "every reading you've entered" : {

    },
    "Every score carries a small honesty label. Calibrating means NOOP is still learning your baseline, or doesn't have enough data yet. Building means there's enough to show, but it's thin. Solid means full inputs are present. When NOOP can't compute a score honestly, it shows nothing rather than a fake number." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every score carries a small honesty label. Calibrating means Sfz Health is still learning your baseline, or doesn't have enough data yet. Building means there's enough to show, but it's thin. Solid means full inputs are present. When Sfz Health can't compute a score honestly, it shows nothing rather than a fake number."
          }
        }
