    },
    "Every score carries a small honesty label. Calibrating means Sfz Health is still learning your baseline, or doesn't have enough data yet. Building means there's enough to show, but it's thin. Solid means full inputs are present. When Sfz Health can't compute a score honestly, it shows nothing rather than a fake number." : {

