    },
    "Holds the liquid gauges, the sky and the tilt response still, and turns off the motion sensor that drives them. Saves battery. Low Power Mode and the system Reduce Motion setting already do this." : {

    },
    "Holds the screen awake while NOOP pulls stored history from your strap, so you can watch a long sync finish without the phone locking. Only applies while a sync is running and NOOP is open. The screen sleeps normally the rest of the time. It uses a bit more battery while the screen stays on." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
