            "value" : "Holds the screen awake while Sfz Health pulls stored history from your WHOOP, so you can watch a long sync finish without the phone locking. Only applies while a sync is running and Sfz Health is open. The screen sleeps normally the rest of the time. It uses a bit more battery while the screen stays on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
