    "Sfz Health removes this device from your list and deletes its recorded data here. You can re-pair the WHOOP to pull its recent history back." : {

    },
    "Sfz Health scores your charge, effort and rest itself: on-device, no cloud." : {

    },
    "Sfz Health shows the %@ reading because it %@ for this metric: a higher-trust source here, not a verdict that the others are wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
