    },
    "Sfz Health stores and lines up the numbers you enter yourself. It does not test you, read your results, give medical advice, or diagnose anything." : {

    },
    "Sfz Health stores this key only on this device, in the same place it stores your paired bands." : {

    },
    "Sfz Health talks to your strap directly over Bluetooth Low Energy. There's no server in the middle. The connection is local, and so is every reading it pulls in." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
