    },
    "Sfz Health: all your data, none of the cloud." : {

    },
    "Sfz Health's own Recovery, Strain and Sleep, computed on your device from published methods." : {

    },
    "Sfz Health's primary, fully-supported band" : {

    },
    "Sfz Health's Recovery score is led by your heart-rate variability measured against your own personal baseline. A chest strap streams beat-to-beat data densely all night, so it can learn that baseline fast. An Apple Watch instead samples HRV, a handful of readings through the day plus overnight, so the signal is real but sparser." : {

