    },
    "Two independent protocol tables disagree on the extended-battery opcode (98 vs 87). This sends the curated read-only 98 and shows the strap's full raw reply. A battery-style payload confirms 98 on your firmware; a short stub means it stays ambiguous. Nothing is written to the strap." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
